<h1 class="h3">Safety guidelines</h1>
<div class="alert alert-danger small"><i class="bi bi-telephone me-1"></i>In an emergency call <strong>112</strong>. Women's helpline: <strong>1091</strong>. Cyber-crime: <strong>1930</strong> / cybercrime.gov.in.</div>
<h2 class="h5">Before you meet</h2>
<ul><li>Chat inside the app first; video-call before meeting in person.</li><li>Look for the <i class="bi bi-patch-check-fill text-primary"></i> verified badge — but remember verification shows control of a college email or a reviewed document, not someone's character.</li><li>Tell a friend where you're going; meet in a public place first.</li></ul>
<h2 class="h5 mt-4">Avoid rent scams</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Never pay a token, deposit or "visit fee" before seeing the place in person</strong> and meeting the owner or current flatmates.</li><li>Be wary of prices far below the area average, pressure to "book now", or requests to pay via gift cards or crypto.</li><li>Get a written agreement and receipts for every payment.</li><li>Our team will never ask you for your password or an OTP.</li></ul>
<h2 class="h5 mt-4">Respect & our rules</h2>
<ul><li>No harassment, hate speech or threats.</li><li>No discrimination on religion, caste, region, race, sexual orientation or disability. Gender-specific housing is allowed only as a stated preference.</li><li>No fake profiles, impersonation, or commercial brokers posing as students.</li><li>Do not post contact details, other people's photos, or personal documents publicly.</li></ul>
<h2 class="h5 mt-4">Report & block</h2>
<p>Every profile, listing and message has <strong>Report</strong> and <strong>Block</strong>. Reports are confidential and reviewed by moderators; serious reports are prioritised. Blocking hides you from each other immediately and ends any match.</p>
